        </td>
        <td width="5" height="617" rowspan="31" bgcolor="#F0F0F0">&nbsp;</td>
        <td width="95" height="617" rowspan="31">&nbsp;</td>
        <td width="585" height="0">&nbsp;</td>
        <td width="100" height="617" rowspan="31"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2"><span style="font-family:굴림;">대원산업 주식회사는 1971년 설립 이후 고품질 및 차별화된 제품으로 고객만족을 </span><span style="font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:굴림;">통해 포장산업의</span></font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2"><span style="font-family:굴림;">미래를 열어가는 21세기의 선도적 기업입니다. <br>
</span></font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2"><span style="font-family:굴림;">대원산업 주식회사는 NYLON, POLYESTER, POLYPROPYLENE, CELLOPHANE, </span><span style="font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:굴림;">POLYETHY</span></font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2"><span style="font-family:굴림;">LENE,</span><span style="font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:굴림;">POLY -VINYL CHLORIDE 등 PLASTIC FILM 및 골판지원지, 마닐라지, 아트지 등 종이외에</span></font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2"><span style="font-family:굴림;">ALUMINUME FOIL( 은박지 )에 GRAVURE 인쇄한 후 당사 </span><span style="font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:굴림;">에서 생산하는 P.E(POLYETHHYLENE)</span></font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2"><span style="font-family:굴림;">필름을 합지(LAMINATION)하고, 필요시 AL-FOIL 및 종이류도 합지하여 식품, 제약,농약, 액상세제</span></font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2"><span style="font-family:굴림;">등 포장용 제품을 생산하는</span><span style="font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:굴림;">업체입니다.<br>
</span></font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2"><span style="font-family:굴림;">30여년 동안 축적된 기술력과 경영 방식으로 차별화된 제품과 서비스를 통해 고객</span><span style="font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:굴림;">만족에 최선을&nbsp;</span></font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2"><span style="font-family:굴림;">다할 것</span><span style="font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:굴림;">입니다.<br>
</span></font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2"><span style="font-family:굴림;">대원산업주식회사는 고객 여러분의 성원에 힘입어 21세기를 선도하는 기업으로</span><span style="font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:굴림;">거듭나고자 생산</span></font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2"><span style="font-family:굴림;">시설확충</span><span style="font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:굴림;">및 고객 만족을 위한 경영 정책을 충분히 준비했습니다.<br>
</span></font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td width="585" height="0">
            <p><font size="2"><span style="font-family:굴림;">이제 고객 여러분께 보답하고자 합니다.</span></font></p>
        </td>
    </tr>
